	(text "BAT54S diode pairs clamp voltage nodes toward GND and AON. The P15 divider\nprovides normal-range headroom without continuous clamp current. Alert response\nbypasses the telemetry filters; actual shutdown also depends on the interlocks\nand power switches."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3ebc752c-f1fd-41be-ad95-3f39e3c4499d")
	)
	(text "Current scales are FPGA 0.2 V/A, ANA 1 V/A and P15 2 V/A. The 10 kOhm LIMIT\nresistors set nominal trips of 4 A, 0.8 A and 0.4 A. FPGA and ANA voltage\ndividers use 1/2; R3609/R3610 use 47 kOhm / 10 kOhm for P15/5.7, giving 2.63 V\nat 15 V. Current filters have a 10 us time constant."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "482b8226-116e-4d37-aed4-712c1b2b0fe7")
	)
