	(text "These channels monitor the FPGA intermediate supply, the analog preregulator and\nthe positive AFE supply. MIRA uses their telemetry to track rail loading during\nstartup and operation; the analog voltage signals also qualify hardware\nreadiness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
